Z||000012||coyote||04-13-2000||02:49 PM||||I am currently working on a 84 that is being cinverted to a removable hard top. I cut out the ends of the uni-body and drove a 2x2x1/8 square tube all the way to the front, then added vertical supports from the tube up a far as it would go. welded the caps and verticals to the uni-body. when i cut the top, i had very little movement.<P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fro2_2.jpg"> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by coyote (edited 04-13-2000).]||||reg||1
