Z||000014||Dan86gt3.8||04-14-2000||04:22 AM||||ohhh fo show.  Like the name implies I have a 3.8 (non supercharged) series II 3.8.  And as far as the austin racing scene, I have dabbled in it a little.  There is a big gathering spot over in this antique mall parking lot in round rock.  It is supposed to go on every saturday night.  Then supposedly they go out by reighning performnace and race.  me and a friend went out one night but there weren't ttoo many people out cause it was really cold, then we went by reigning and it was mostly ricers so we took off.  They are supposed to go out and race on ben white or out by reighning, but we never saw any of the action.  But I have found a cruising spot here in san marcos it is mainly some rednecks and some ricers, none of them are that fast.  There are no ls1's or pr hpt mustangs.  The fastest out there are like 14 second cars.  BUt I am sure you could get into some real cars in A-town.  we were coming home friday night and got passed by a 3 car viper caravan.  It was a GTS, an RT/10 red, and a rt/10 black.  We are pretty saure thats where they were coming from (the antique mall parking lot , Also earlier in the day we saw a ferarri 355 getting on 35.  Anyways thats all I can think of talk to you later <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||12
